    "detailed_description": "Slalomancers is a 1-button multiplayer space shooter that's easy to learn and hard to master! Weave your way around bullets and blast enemy ships to smithereens!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Tackle a 200 level solo campaign with difficulty ranging from casual to hardcore<br />\r\n- Play cooperatively or competitively with up to 4 players on the same device in Party Mode<br />\r\n- Explore randomized dungeons in Maze Mode while coordinating with a teammate to unlock powerups<br />\r\n- Develop unique strategies to fight over 15 different enemy types<br />\r\n- Train individual skills such as evasion, accuracy, and navigation in Training Mode<br />\r\n- Create your own unique challenges in Custom Mode<br />\r\n- NO rubber banding, power creep, or pay-to-win mechanics - progress in this game must be earned",
